# customer delivery data - THIS REPO IS PUBLIC.
# Market rows, citations and audits are the customer's asset and must never be pushed here. The
# private upstream repo holds anything that has to be version-controlled. Nothing covered
# these before, so a single `git add -A` from the repo root was enough to publish a delivery.
citations_extracted.csv
citations_*.csv
candidate_urls*.csv
*_audited.csv
*_seed.csv
*.before-merge-*.csv
runs_out/
# NOT market_sheets/ wholesale - that folder has its own rule, and held_rows.txt is a record
# of deliberate decisions that must stay tracked.
# Operational inputs that carry delivery rows. These slipped past the rules above on
# 2026-08-11 and reached four local commits before a pre-push check caught them: the
# earlier patterns named citations_* and candidate_urls* but not these. Name the SHAPE of
# the data, not the filenames you happen to have used.
operator_verified*.csv
overrides*.csv
retire_*.csv
dead_hosts*.txt
pilot*_out.csv
pilot*_recovered*.csv
rerun_*.csv
menu_followups*.csv
dashboard/
docs/agents/results/
page_library/

